OL,3,GNEWSAMan hurt after van hits tent at
OL,4,Afantasy festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been seriously injured after
OL,7,Fa VW campervan collided with a tent
OL,8,Ffollowing a fantasy festival at a
OL,9,Fstately home.
OL,11,FHertfordshire Police said the man, in
OL,12,Fhis 40s, was taken to hospital
OL,13,Ffollowing the incident at Hatfield Park
OL,14,Fat 07:50 BST on Monday.
OL,16,FSgt Tim Davies said: "This collision
OL,17,Foccurred at a time when a number of
OL,18,Fpeople were on site following an event
OL,19,Fat the venue the previous day.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
